Changes to source material
The original source files are retained byte for byte. Context passages select
continuous Unicode ranges containing complete adjacent prose/code blocks.
The source files already use LF, so no line-ending or source-word changes
are present. RST, Markdown and SGML markup remain visible in the excerpts.
Exact source revisions, URLs, hashes, licenses and extraction ranges are in
source-metadata.json and the dataset manifests. The answers and annotations
were separately authored by AI; controlled answer edits and subsequent
annotation revisions are identified in the case metadata.

The author-draft dataset is retained only for annotation-review history. It
is not a second independent benchmark population. This package contains
only development pilot cases and no held-out test cases.
